.TH "TRANSITIONEVENT.ANIMATION" "3JS" "July 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
TransitionEvent.animation \- TransitionEvent: animation property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]animation\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]TransitionEvent\f[R] interface represents the animation associated
with the event.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]CSSTransition\f[R], or \f[CR]null\f[R].
